  "description": "When you spend hours in the saddle getting to a jaw-dropping descent, your bike should 100 percent rip. Those are the days for the Release 29 3. This aluminum trail bike is built on a 130mm travel Level Link suspension platform. We’ve adjusted the geometry for 29-inch tubeless ready wheels while keeping the same playful attitude of all our Level Link bikes. A Sram GX Eagle drivetrain paired with Sram Stylo cranks provides crisp shifts. The Fox Performance Elite Float DPS rear shock offers improved performance on the most aggressive descents plus a greater compression adjustment range. For truly hairy descents, the 140mm travel Fox 34 Performance fork and Shimano XT brakes keep you laser-focused.",
